    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but enduring it feels so pointless. if they've already decided that i'm a monster, then what's the point of even being around to hear it? it feels like i'm just a shell of a human being. if the person i was is gone, and the person they see is a villain... i just don't see a reason to keep dragging this ghost around anymore.",
